          "merged_at": "2026-09-09T15:09:21Z"
        },
        "body": "## Problem\nFresh runtime logs show the anonymous market observer reaching Vinted, but the OneTrust preference-center overlay (`.onetrust-pc-dark-filter` / `#onetrust-policy-text`) intercepts category-filter clicks. As a result, exact VINTED_MODEL targets fail before any scan/publication-time backfill can be recorded, so PR #160 correctly leaves `published_at` unknown and the calendar counters stay at 0.\n\n## Changes\n- restore the narrow OneTrust preference-center guard that was previously proven in PR #149 and got lost when stable was rolled back to the 2026-09-06 base\n- handle standard accept-all, `accept-recommended`, and OneTrust's own save/close controls\n- bounded 500 ms poll catches preference-center state changes that do not emit a useful DOM mutation\n- do not remove overlays or force-click through them\n- add regression coverage\n\n## Scope\nNo changes to session files, login semantics, CAPTCHA handling, negotiation logic, market counting semantics, or publication-time parsing.",
